# Session handoff
PROGRESS.md

# Local, per-developer Claude Code settings (the shared config is .claude/settings.json)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Test-list lock marker: created and removed by the human, never committed
.tests-locked

# Agent and evaluator scratch. The Stop hook commits whatever is uncommitted so
# a session's work is recoverable, which once swept an evaluator's scratch
# directory into a feature branch as a "wip: session backstop" commit. Scratch
# belongs in the job temp directory; these patterns stop the ones that leak.
.review-scratch/
.scratch/
*.scratch.*
/scratch.*
/tmp/
